\u0001\tGraphics\tColor Cycling\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tColor Cycling\tColor cycling effect used for water, lava, and acid animation.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGraphics\tAlternate nest art\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAlternate nest art\tThe game will use an alternative palette for Hellfire’s nest tileset.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGraphics\tShow FPS\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tShow FPS\tDisplays the FPS in the upper left corner of the screen.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tRun in Town\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tRun in Town\tEnable jogging/fast walking in town for Diablo and Hellfire. This option was introduced in the expansion.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tGrab Input\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tGrab Input\tWhen enabled mouse is locked to the game window.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tTheo Quest\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tTheo Quest\tEnable Little Girl quest.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tCow Quest\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tCow Quest\tEnable Jersey's quest. Lester the farmer is replaced by the Complete Nut.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tFriendly Fire\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tFriendly Fire\tAllow arrow/spell damage between players in multiplayer even when the friendly mode is on.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tMultiplayerFullQuests\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tFull quests in Multiplayer\tEnables the full/uncut singleplayer version of quests.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tTest Bard\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tTest Bard\tForce the Bard character type to appear in the hero selection menu.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tTest Barbarian\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tTest Barbarian\tForce the Barbarian character type to appear in the hero selection menu.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tExperience Bar\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tExperience Bar\tExperience Bar is added to the UI at the bottom of the screen.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tShow Item Graphics in Stores\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tShow Item Graphics in Stores\tShow item graphics to the left of item descriptions in store menus.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tShow health values\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tShow health values\tDisplays current / max health value on health globe.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tShow mana values\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tShow mana values\tDisplays current / max mana value on mana globe.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tEnemy Health Bar\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tEnemy Health Bar\tEnemy Health Bar is displayed at the top of the screen.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Gold Pickup\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Gold Pickup\tGold is automatically collected when in close proximity to the player.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Elixir Pickup\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Elixir Pickup\tElixirs are automatically collected when in close proximity to the player.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Oil Pickup\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Oil Pickup\tOils are automatically collected when in close proximity to the player.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Pickup in Town\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Pickup in Town\tAutomatically pickup items in town.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAdria Refills Mana\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAdria Refills Mana\tAdria will refill your mana when you visit her shop.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Equip Weapons\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Equip Weapons\tWeapons will be automatically equipped on pickup or purchase if enabled.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Equip Armor\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Equip Armor\tArmor will be automatically equipped on pickup or purchase if enabled.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Equip Helms\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Equip Helms\tHelms will be automatically equipped on pickup or purchase if enabled.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Equip Shields\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Equip Shields\tShields will be automatically equipped on pickup or purchase if enabled.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Equip Jewelry\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Equip Jewelry\tJewelry will be automatically equipped on pickup or purchase if enabled.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tRandomize Quests\tBOOL\t1\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tRandomize Quests\tRandomly selecting available quests for new games.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tShow Monster Type\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tShow Monster Type\tHovering over a monster will display the type of monster in the description box in the UI.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tShow Item Labels\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tShow Item Labels\tShow labels for items on the ground when enabled.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tAuto Refill Belt\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tAuto Refill Belt\tRefill belt from inventory when belt item is consumed.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tDisable Crippling Shrines\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tDisable Crippling Shrines\tWhen enabled Cauldrons, Fascinating Shrines, Goat Shrines, Ornate Shrines, Sacred Shrines and Murphy's Shrines are not able to be clicked on and labeled as disabled.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tQuick Cast\tBOOL\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tQuick Cast\tSpell hotkeys instantly cast the spell, rather than switching the readied spell.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tHeal Potion Pickup\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001F1\u001F2\u001F4\u001F8\u001F16\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tHeal Potion Pickup\tNumber of Healing potions to pick up automatically.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tFull Heal Potion Pickup\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001F1\u001F2\u001F4\u001F8\u001F16\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tFull Heal Potion Pickup\tNumber of Full Healing potions to pick up automatically.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tMana Potion Pickup\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001F1\u001F2\u001F4\u001F8\u001F16\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tMana Potion Pickup\tNumber of Mana potions to pick up automatically.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tFull Mana Potion Pickup\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001F1\u001F2\u001F4\u001F8\u001F16\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tFull Mana Potion Pickup\tNumber of Full Mana potions to pick up automatically.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tRejuvenation Potion Pickup\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001F1\u001F2\u001F4\u001F8\u001F16\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tRejuvenation Potion Pickup\tNumber of Rejuvenation potions to pick up automatically.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tFull Rejuvenation Potion Pickup\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\t\u0001\t0\u001F1\u001F2\u001F4\u001F8\u001F16\t1\t\u0001\t1.5.5,1.5.4,1.5.3,1.5.2\tFull Rejuvenation Potion Pickup\tNumber of Full Rejuvenation potions to pick up automatically.\t\u0001\ndevilutionx\t\u0001\tGame\tEnable floating numbers\tENUM\t0\t\u0001\